    "outcome": "The Stewards, exercising their authority given under Article 11.7.3.r of the FIA International Sporting Code, decided to temporarily stop Free Practice 3. Free Practice 3 was red flagged at 12:53:17 following an incident which required the safety barriers to be repaired. As it turned out that these repairs required significantly more time than initially expected, the session was stopped at 13:14:22 with 15 minutes and 38 seconds remaining. The timing systems were stopped at this point in time. The session was restarted at 13:32:00, the timing systems were resumed and the remainder of the session was completed.",
